---
name: Onboard Cisco ASA logs via syslog UDP
description: |
  Receives Cisco Secure Firewall ASA logs over UDP syslog, one message per
  datagram, parses them, and publishes the events to the `cisco` topic.
---

accept_udp "0.0.0.0:514"
// ASA writes local times without a zone, except in the RFC 5424 format.
cisco::asa::parse message=data, timezone="Europe/Berlin"
publish "cisco"
